            "notes": "# ROUND 2\n\n[Dauntless Draught](item_5cd19f82-4687-4931-ab9d-2a2a63903861) is the ultimate repositioning tool. It turns your [Get Out Of Traffic Ticket Free Card](ability_c6282740-1c2f-49b6-b2d4-934ee46aeb70) into a [Get Out Of Jail Free Card](ability_c6282740-1c2f-49b6-b2d4-934ee46aeb70). \n\nThe movement speed increase on [Dauntless Draught](item_5cd19f82-4687-4931-ab9d-2a2a63903861) is what's called a \"more multiplier\". That means it's multiplying your movement speed at the END of the movement speed calculation. This means combined with [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) or [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa), you'll be going 40%-50% faster CONSTANTLY.",
