            "notes": "# Round 3\n\nWe can pick up [Nightcreeper](item_d13ac4bd-e7be-4c95-9715-08a475fb3486) which is great. When we're inside the enemies walls, it's good to be able to see them and track them to make sure they don't catch sight of you while you're moving. \n\nYou want to make sure that, ideally, the enemy only sees you when you're far away and standing still. This inflicts the most amount of psychic damage on them. \n\n---\n\n[Backstabber](item_74a5a7f4-ff45-4cbd-b7b0-9127e4000990) is a no brainer. No other power in the game gives you a larger singe shot damage increase. \n\nSince we have a hard time building ult charge because of how much space we're making, we take [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c). This item is the unsung hero of the build. It usually is the difference maker between ever getting to use your ult. With this item, we can EASILY get halfway to our ult every round.\n\n---\n\n[example 2](https://youtube.com/embed/wybrdEUQSWU)",
