            "notes": "**ROUND 5**\n\nI can already hear [Kiba](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) saying \"erm actually [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)?\"\n\n[Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) is a double edged sword in stadium, especially so for [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457). \nReaper's damage is 5.75 \u2013 1.725 per pellet || 115 \u2013 34.5 per shot at a 10 \u2013 20 meters falloff range. That means beyond 20 meters, you are doing basically zero damage no matter what. And since 90%-95% of games are [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) mirrors, it's pretty impossible to play within your effective range of 0-10 meters no matter what. \n\nWe take [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for more [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).",
