            "notes": "# ROUND 5:\n\n*Showtime.*\n\nWe pick up [Ghosted](item_bacfcb1d-f655-4a22-9f04-621f8c49815d) because using our wraith form to fly through enemies inflicts a high degree of terror and dismay upon them. As a bonus, this power actually allows us to decrease their [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and [Movement Speed](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa). And since I'm sure you're asking yourself this right now, yes, this is a more multiplier. This means that it applies after the rest of their movement speed calculations, so if they have movement speed bonuses it actually slows their raw movement speed even further. It also stacks with [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98), so we will be taking that item.\n\nSo you're basically **[The Slenderman]**, ominously watching your prey, then you fly right through the enemies like a freaking ghost, which slows them to like 30% movement speed out of genuine IRL fear. Yeah. That seems balanced Blizzard. \ud83d\ude02\n\n---\n\n[Example number 3](https://youtube.com/embed/W9mpSfVQtEE)\n\n---\n\n*\"I am... darkness...\"*\n\n-Author Unknown\n\n---\n\n*\"This [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457)... he is Evil of the Purest Form and Highest Caliber....\"*\n\n-Author Also Unknown (deceased)",
