            "notes": "**ROUND 6**\n\nAt this point, most toons are really strong and are really tanky. No matter... they cannot hurt pure shadow.\n\nTake [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for backline threat. They're the obvious choice at this point. \n\nIdeally, both of their healers are constantly turning around looking for you. **You've successfully turned the game into a 4v3 for the rest of your team.** While you may be 20k down from the entire lobby, you are the intangible MVP of your team and a 580 lb. frothing feral hog attacking the enemy [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317).",
