            "notes": "# ROUND 7\n\n[Vampiric Touch](item_fa461c97-36bc-43cc-a2f7-6f854096e06b) ends up really being the foundational piece of our build that everything else is built on.\n\nIt lets you mark an enemy so that your teammates have an indicator that tells them who to focus. No other hero has access to a power that does that. It also synergizes with [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c) because it doubles the effect for your entire team. \n\nIt takes the dread from being conceptual to being real. Because for the other 6 rounds, the enemies *know* you're behind them but they never see you. But now? They can see which of their teammates has been marked for death.\n\n[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) allows us to safely apply our [Vampiric Touch](item_fa461c97-36bc-43cc-a2f7-6f854096e06b) and rotate without having to burn our cooldowns unnecessarily.",
